// The site, written at each build (`mcpp build`, `omui build`) into target/site: every route's index.html (read
// with no script) and index.md, the routes table, the search index, llms.txt, the sitemap, the delivery manifest.
// A page changed, added or taken away builds it again; a route over its budget or an example that cannot run
// fails the build, naming it.
import mcpp;
import oweb.rules;

int main() { return oweb::rules::site() ? 0 : 1; }
